<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish Feb producer output prices fall 0.3 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>Irish Feb producer output prices fall 0.3 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish output prices for the manufacturing industries fell 0.3 percent in February and were down 2.1 percent from a year ago, Central Statistics Office data showed on Friday.</p>
<p>	     Index (base 1985)  Monthly change  Yearly change</p>
<p>Latest month	    118.7	  -0.3		  -2.1</p>
<p>Previous month	119.1	  -0.3		 -1.7</p>
<p>Year-ago month	121.3	  +0.2		+2.7</p>
<p>--Dublin newsroom 353-1-661-3377</p>
</text>
